<title>GREECE: INTRASOFT-SOGEI HAND OVER TAXIS APPLICATIONS - MINISTRY.</title>
<headline>INTRASOFT-SOGEI HAND OVER TAXIS APPLICATIONS - MINISTRY.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Intrasoft-Sogei group delivered six basic software applications of the Taxis programme today, the finance ministry said in a statement.</p>
<p>The finance ministry has pinned its hopes to combat tax evasion in the development of the Taxis system which is heavily subsidised by the European Union. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
